#: simulation/data/civs/brit.json simulation/data/civs/gaul.json
msgid "Celtic religion and druidry inspired their warlike mindset."
msgstr "凱爾特人的宗教信仰及德魯伊激發了他們的好戰心態。"

#: simulation/data/civs/brit.json simulation/data/civs/gaul.json
msgid "Druids increase attack rates of soldiers near them by 5%."
msgstr "德魯依增加其附近士兵的攻擊速度 5%。"

#: simulation/data/civs/cart.json
msgid "Trademasters"
msgstr "貿易能手"

#: simulation/data/civs/cart.json
msgid ""
"The Carthaginians were broadly known for their extensive trade over the "
"Mediterranean Sea."
msgstr "迦太基人因其在地中海的廣泛貿易而聞名。"

#: simulation/data/civs/cart.json
msgid "Trade ships are available in the Village Phase."
msgstr "貿易船隻在村莊階段可用。"

#: simulation/data/civs/cart.json
msgid "Mining Economy"
msgstr "礦業經濟"

#: simulation/data/civs/cart.json
msgid ""
"The Carthaginian economy was centered around mining, with stone comprising "
"much of Carthage's structures."
msgstr "迦太基的經濟以採礦業為中心，迦太基的大部分建築都是由石材建造的。"

#: simulation/data/civs/cart.json
msgid "Stone mining technologies are free and instant."
msgstr "石材開採科技是免費且立即完成的。"

#: simulation/data/civs/cart.json
msgid "Numidian Cavalry"
msgstr "努米底亞騎兵"

#: simulation/data/civs/cart.json
msgid ""
"The Numidian cavalry's horses, ancestors of the Berber horse, were small "
"compared with other horses of the era, and were well adapted for faster "
"movement over long distances."
msgstr "努米底亞騎兵的馬是柏柏爾馬的祖先，與同時期的其他馬相比體型較小，非常適合長距離快速移動。"

#: simulation/data/civs/cart.json
msgid "Cavalry Javelineers +10% walk speed."
msgstr "標槍騎兵 +10% 移動速度。"

